# Local orchestrator state (docs/ORCHESTRATION.md): one JSON file per task under
# .orchestrator/state/, plus review handoff packets. There is no forge, so this
# IS the authoritative task board while a programme run is in flight - but it is
# machine-local and per-run, so it is not committed. Ground truth for what
# actually happened is git itself (branches, merges, tags); `node
# scripts/task.mjs init` re-seeds the board if this directory is lost.
.orchestrator/

